a slumber party lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T07:42:33-08:00","id":1429508,"title":"","content":"Mekhet find the killer, Gangrel go get the cops or at least find out what\u2019s going to stop the people who try.<br /> Honestly this would probably work better if the players were Ghouls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T15:35:35-08:00","id":1429570,"title":"","content":"Just had an idea for how this can last over several days; there's an entrance to a cave system hidden in the shrubbery right outside the house that the killer (alongside the kid hosting the whole event and his family) somehow missed. Thanks to the PCs being Kindred, they're able to get in and out relatively easily without anyone really noticing. The main problem is figuring out how to justify not being present for a good portion of the daytime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 01-09-2021, 09:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T17:37:27-08:00","id":1429579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1429020-chronicle-idea-caught-in-a-teen-slasher-movie?p=1429570#post1429570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just had an idea for how this can last over several days; there's an entrance to a cave system hidden in the shrubbery right outside the house that the killer (alongside the kid hosting the whole event and his family) somehow missed. Thanks to the PCs being Kindred, they're able to get in and out relatively easily without anyone really easily. The main problem is figuring out how to justify not being present for a good portion of the daytime.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe a cold war bunker or hidden cellar from Prohibition-era the clique is not aware of?<br /> <br /> Also, if people are affraid of having a psycho in their midst, hiding oneself to sleep alone <b>does </b>sound like a passably legit excuse, i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T04:23:51-08:00","id":1429608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1429020-chronicle-idea-caught-in-a-teen-slasher-movie?p=1429579#post1429579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe a cold war bunker or hidden cellar from Prohibition-era the clique is not aware of?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much, yeah. The idea is that there's a 'secret/hidden location' with an entrance located somewhere in or near the house the the killer(s) is unaware of and the PCs can camp in during the day.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1429020-chronicle-idea-caught-in-a-teen-slasher-movie?p=1429579#post1429579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, if people are affraid of having a psycho in their midst, hiding oneself to sleep alone <b>does </b>sound like a passably legit excuse, i guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or sticking together with people that are known to be safe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http